Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: 
Recommends: gnome-control-center
Maintainer: washingtoneimae <washingtoneimae@gmail.com>
Description: PeerDrop LAN (Go) - send files directly between PCs on a local network
 PeerDrop LAN is a small desktop app for sending files and folders directly
 between computers on the same Wi-Fi, Ethernet, or mobile hotspot - no cloud,
 no account, no internet upload. Files transfer over your local network only.
 .
 Features:
  - Discover nearby PCs automatically on the LAN
  - Send files or whole folders to one or many PCs at once
  - Cancel an in-progress transfer from either the sender or receiver
  - Wire-compatible with the Python and Windows versions of PeerDrop LAN
